│ Help · Linear                                                                │
│ The project's Linear board: your personal Linear connection, and the board   │
│ this project is linked to. Task ownership comes from the coordinator's issue │
│ assignment; selecting a row never claims or completes work. In Intake (n),   │
│ only a needs-agent label, delegation or mention a trusted person makes in    │
│ Linear itself counts; signals made through ClawBridge run as the app and are │
│ never trusted.                                                               │
│                                                                              │
│ This screen                                                                  │
│   Enter      next                                                            │
│   Space      select (not now)                                                │
│   n          Intake (not now)                                                │
│   d          show IDs (not now)                                              │
│   +          connect                                                         │
│   w          connect with write                                              │
│   l          link a board (not now)                                          │
│   u          unlink (not now)                                                │
│   x          log out                                                         │
│   a          trust someone (not now)                                         │
│   e          rearm (not now)                                                 │
│   ]          next page (not now)                                             │
│   [          previous page (not now)                                         │
